          <p class="cap" id="editCap">
            <span class="lang-en">YaRN = NTK-by-parts + temperature. Per dial, r = L/λ counts
              full rotations inside the original context L. Fast dials (r above β = 32) are
              left untouched; dials whose wavelength exceeds the trained context (r below
              α = 1) get full interpolation θ/s; the middle is linearly blended (Eq. 8, 10,
              11, 13). One extra scalar — logits scaled by 0.1·ln(s) + 1 — rides along for
              free: HF bakes it into the cos/sin cache as attention_scaling.</span>
            <span class="lang-ko">YaRN = NTK-by-parts + temperature. 다이얼마다 r = L/λ가
              원래 context L 안에서의 회전 수를 센다. 빠른 다이얼(r이 β = 32 초과)은
              그대로 두고, wavelength가 학습 context보다 긴 다이얼(r이 α = 1 미만)은 완전
              interpolation θ/s를 받고, 중간은 선형 blend된다 (Eq. 8, 10, 11, 13). 스칼라
              하나가 덤으로 붙는다 — logit에 0.1·ln(s) + 1을 곱하는 temperature인데, HF는
              이를 attention_scaling으로 cos/sin cache에 구워 넣는다.</span>
          </p>

          <noscript>
            <p class="viz-sub">
              <span class="lang-en">The static plot shows YaRN at s = 4; the four cards
                below cover each method without JavaScript.</span>
              <span class="lang-ko">정적 그래프는 s = 4의 YaRN이다. 아래 카드 네 장이
                JavaScript 없이도 각 기법을 설명한다.</span>
            </p>
          </noscript>
        </div>

        <div class="card-grid to-grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>PI <span class="to-year">Chen et al. 2023 · 2306.15595</span></h3>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-en">Position Interpolation, Eq. 4: f′(x, m) = f(x, m·L/L′) —
                indices down-scaled, so every dial slows by the same s. Motivation:
                extrapolating past the trained length can produce "catastrophically high
                attention scores"; the interpolated perturbation is bounded ≈600× tighter
                (Thm 2.1, LLaMA constants). Works with ~1,000 fine-tune steps (2048 → 32768).
                The cost, per YaRN: the uniform rescale "removes the high frequency
                components of RoPE" — local order blurs, and PI fine-tunes degraded beyond
                s ≈ 8.</span>
              <span class="lang-ko">Position Interpolation, Eq. 4: f′(x, m) = f(x, m·L/L′) —
                index를 줄이므로 모든 다이얼이 같은 s만큼 느려진다. 동기는 안전성:
                학습 길이 밖으로 extrapolate하면 "파국적으로 높은 attention score"가 나올
                수 있고, interpolation의 섭동은 약 600× 더 좁게 bound된다 (Thm 2.1, LLaMA
                상수). fine-tune 약 1,000 step이면 된다 (2048 → 32768). 대가는, YaRN의
                표현으로, 균일 rescale이 "RoPE의 high frequency 성분을 제거"한다는 것 —
                국소 순서가 뭉개지고, PI fine-tune은 s ≈ 8을 넘으면 열화됐다.</span>
            </p>
            <span class="ev-chip">every dial ÷ s · fastest λ 6.3 → 6.3·s tokens</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>NTK-aware <span class="to-year">formalized in YaRN · Eq. 19–20</span></h3>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-en">Change the base instead: b′ = b·s^(d/(d−2)), designed so
                "the lowest frequency needs to be scaled as much as linear positional scaling
                and the highest frequency to stay constant." The result is a geometric tilt
                of the ladder: dial 0 exactly unchanged, the last dial at exactly θ/s,
                everything between graded [per-band ratio θ′ᵢ/θᵢ = s^(−2i/(d−2)), derived
                from the quoted formula]. At s = 4, d = 128: b′ ≈ 40,890.</span>
              <span class="lang-ko">대신 base를 바꾼다: b′ = b·s^(d/(d−2)). "가장 낮은
                frequency는 linear scaling만큼 줄고 가장 높은 frequency는 그대로"가 되도록
                설계됐다. 결과는 사다리의 기하급수 기울이기: 다이얼 0은 정확히 그대로,
                마지막 다이얼은 정확히 θ/s, 그 사이는 등비로 눕는다 [band별 비율
                θ′ᵢ/θᵢ = s^(−2i/(d−2)), 인용 공식에서 유도]. s = 4, d = 128이면
                b′ ≈ 40,890.</span>
            </p>
            <span class="ev-chip">dial 0 fixed · dial 63 exactly ÷ s</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>YaRN <span class="to-year">Peng et al. 2023 · 2309.00071</span></h3>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-en">Make the tilt piecewise and explicit: per dial,
                r(d) = L/λ_d; γ(r) = 0 below α, 1 above β, linear between; new frequency
                h(θ) = (1−γ)·θ/s + γ·θ. Recommended α = 1, β = 32 for the Llama family —
                dials that rotate more than 32 times inside L keep their exact speed; dials
                that cannot finish one rotation get full PI treatment. Plus the attention
                temperature √(1/t) = 0.1·ln(s) + 1.</span>
              <span class="lang-ko">기울이기를 조각별로, 명시적으로: 다이얼마다
                r(d) = L/λ_d; γ(r)는 α 아래 0, β 위 1, 사이 선형; 새 frequency는
                h(θ) = (1−γ)·θ/s + γ·θ. Llama 계열 권장값 α = 1, β = 32 — L 안에서 32번
                넘게 도는 다이얼은 속도를 정확히 지키고, 한 바퀴도 못 도는 다이얼은 완전한
                PI 처리를 받는다. 여기에 attention temperature
                √(1/t) = 0.1·ln(s) + 1이 더해진다.</span>
            </p>
            <span class="ev-chip">α=1 · β=32 · γ ramp over r = L/λ</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3><span class="lang-en">Base-scaling</span><span class="lang-ko">Base-scaling</span> <span class="to-year">Llama-3 / Qwen3 configs</span></h3>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-en">The pretraining-era route: ship a bigger base from day
                one. Llama-3-8B: rope_theta = 500,000 (config.json, max_position 8,192);
                Qwen3-8B: 1,000,000 (max_position 40,960; rope_scaling null). The whole
                ladder is stretched at train time — Llama-3's slowest dial has wavelength
                ≈ 2.56M tokens [computed from λ = 2π·base^((d−2)/d)], so slow dials stay
                near-static over any real context. Barbero et al.: increasing θ prevents
                tokens "being erroneously misaligned simply due to the large context."</span>
              <span class="lang-ko">pretraining 시절부터의 경로: 처음부터 큰 base로
                출시한다. Llama-3-8B: rope_theta = 500,000 (config.json, max_position
                8,192); Qwen3-8B: 1,000,000 (max_position 40,960; rope_scaling null).
                사다리 전체가 train 시점에 늘어난다 — Llama-3의 가장 느린 다이얼은
                wavelength ≈ 2.56M token [λ = 2π·base^((d−2)/d)에서 계산]이라, 느린
                다이얼들은 어떤 실제 context에서도 거의 정지 상태다. Barbero et al.:
                θ를 키우는 것은 token들이 "단지 context가 크다는 이유로 잘못
                어긋나는" 것을 막는다.</span>
            </p>
            <span class="ev-chip">train-time · no post-hoc ramp</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- partial rotary -->
        <h3 class="sub-h">
          <span class="lang-en">Partial RoPE — dials that never existed</span>
          <span class="lang-ko">Partial RoPE — 처음부터 없는 다이얼</span>
        </h3>
        <div class="viz-frame">
          <div class="prot-row">
            <span class="prot-label">GPT-NeoX-20B<i>head_dim 96 · rotary_pct 0.25</i></span>
            <div class="prot-track"
              data-tip="GPT-NeoX paper: 'we follow Wang and Komatsuzaki [GPT-J] and instead apply it only to the first 25% of embedding vector dimensions. Our initial experiments indicate that this strikes the best balance of performance and computational efficiency.'"
              data-tip-ko="GPT-NeoX 논문: 'Wang과 Komatsuzaki [GPT-J]를 따라 embedding vector 차원의 앞 25%에만 적용한다. 초기 실험에서 이것이 성능과 계산 효율의 최선의 균형이었다.'">
              <span class="prot-rot" style="width:25%">24 rotated</span>
              <span class="prot-free">72 dims — never rotated · position-free</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="prot-row">
            <span class="prot-label">Qwen3.5-27B<i>head_dim 256 · partial_rotary_factor 0.25</i></span>
            <div class="prot-track"
              data-tip="Qwen3.5-27B config.json: rope_parameters with partial_rotary_factor 0.25, rope_theta 10,000,000, mrope_interleaved true, mrope_section [11,11,10] — the 32 rotated pairs are split across temporal/height/width axes (multimodal mRoPE), and only every 4th layer is full attention (hybrid stack). Not a clean dense example — flags below."
              data-tip-ko="Qwen3.5-27B config.json: rope_parameters에 partial_rotary_factor 0.25, rope_theta 10,000,000, mrope_interleaved true, mrope_section [11,11,10] — 회전되는 32개 pair가 temporal/height/width 축으로 나뉘고(멀티모달 mRoPE), 4개 layer마다 하나만 full attention이다(hybrid stack). 깔끔한 dense 예시가 아니다 — 아래 플래그 참고.">
              <span class="prot-rot" style="width:25%">64 rotated</span>
              <span class="prot-free">192 dims — never rotated · position-free</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="wire-stats">
            <span class="stat-chip">Qwen3.5 flags: hybrid — full attention every 4th layer</span>
            <span class="stat-chip">mRoPE sections 11/11/10 (multimodal)</span>
            <span class="stat-chip">θ = 10,000,000</span>
          </div>
          <p class="fine-inline">
            <span class="lang-en">Attribution matters here: GPT-NeoX's stated reason for 25%
              partial rotary is the performance/efficiency balance (following GPT-J). The
              reading of unrotated dims as a deliberate "distance-agnostic semantic channel"
              arrives later, with Barbero et al.'s p-RoPE (section d) — which removes the
              lowest frequencies rather than leaving dims unrotated from the start.</span>
            <span class="lang-ko">여기서는 attribution이 중요하다: GPT-NeoX가 밝힌 25%
              partial rotary의 이유는 성능/효율 균형이다 (GPT-J를 따름). 회전되지 않는
              차원을 의도적인 "거리-불변 semantic channel"로 읽는 해석은 나중에 Barbero
              et al.의 p-RoPE(section d)와 함께 온다 — p-RoPE는 처음부터 안 돌리는 게
              아니라 가장 낮은 frequency를 제거하는 쪽이다.</span>
          </p>
